{"id":3090,"name":"Utawarerumono: Itsuwari no Kamen","slug":"utawarerumono_itsuwari_no_kamen","synopsis":"When I came to, I realized I was standing in the middle of a vast, snowy plain I knew nothing of. I didn't know how I got there. And to add to that, I couldn't remember anything, not even my name. I stood there, dumbfounded at my absurd situation. But then, as if to spite me further, a gigantic monster suddenly appeared, an insect-like creature that began to bear down on me. I tried desperately to run, but it cornered me into a hopeless situation. It was then that the girl appeared. Her name was Kuon. It was this beautiful girl, who bore an animal's ears and tail, who saved my life.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2015,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:47","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 09:16:45","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":30901},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":21218},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":11021},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":11272},{"site":"ANN","externalId":17186},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":7258},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":6165,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/JUaEf1ocn3ljSebQHHy7st26TDMesOekynqhCFlJ.png"},{"id":6166,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/xSSS6xoA0J1MkcgVl5jpmpNsDFBrjBc3nasmKLBg.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":48,"name":"White Fox","slug":"white_fox"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":177,"name":"Utawarerumono","slug":"utawarerumono"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":6145,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":6145,"title":"Fuantei na Kamisama","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":7102,"version":1,"episodes":"2-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":6024,"basename":"UtawarerumonoItsuwariNoKamen-OP1.webm","filename":"UtawarerumonoItsuwariNoKamen-OP1